(7764636, 1287065, 138630, '<td valign="top">
<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LevT:</b></div><hr/><i> Amazing! Never saw anything like this! Where is it? </i></td></tr></table>
<br/>
<br/>Loess Bluffs NWR in the NW corner of Missouri.  The snow geese migrate through late fall and early spring - spring (the birds think it''s late February, I disagree) is the most impressive.  It''s not just a sight, it''s an immersive experience.  They had actually been at their peak about a week earlier than we were there this year because we''d had an unseasonably warm spell; when that happens, they don''t hang around as long.  But it''s always worth going.</td>', 'Originally posted by LevT: Amazing! Never saw anything like this! Where is it? 

Loess Bluffs NWR in the NW corner of Missouri.  The snow geese migrate through late fall and early spring - spring (the birds think it''s late February, I disagree) is the most impressive.  It''s not just a sight, it''s an immersive experience.  They had actually been at their peak about a week earlier than we were there this year because we''d had an unseasonably warm spell; when that happens, they don''t hang around as long.  But it''s always worth going.', '2024-03-08 22:27:23.000000', NULL, 0),
